ressure"}, {"text": "Ethereum outperforms Bitcoin with 11% rise as ETF inflows, particularly from BlackRock''s fund, boost investor confidence.", "url": "https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/07/16/ether-outruns-bitcoin-as-etf-money-returns-almost-all-of-from-blackrocks-fund"}, {"text": "Citigroup lowers 12-month forecasts for Bitcoin and Ethereum, citing negative ETF flows and lack of U.S. digital asset legislation progress.", "url": "https://ca.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/citi-cuts-bitcoin-ether-forecasts-as-etf-flows-turn-negative-4715280"}, {"text": "Bitcoin and Ethereum ETFs experience combined outflows of $800 million amid market downturn and investor ''extreme fear''.", "url": "https://www.theblock.co/news/markets/2025/11/05/bitcoin-ethereum-etf-800-million-outflows-377723"}, {"text": "Bitcoin''s price recovers above $114,000 after a significant market sell-off, indicating potential stabilization.", "url": "https://www.theblock.co/news/markets/2025/10/13/bitcoin-ethereum-rebound-following-massive-wipeout-374302"}]',0,'gpt-4o-mini',0.011480000000000001314,'');
