valid held-out candidate  \n  Walk-forward #175 over 2026-07-25→2026-09-21: adaptive-policy diagnostic 36 trades, net -92.91, PF 0.88, decay 0.4457006892781591. On the identical final held-out window, candidate: 0 trades, PF 0.00, net +0.00; current champion: 0 trades, PF 0.00, net +0.00. Recommended: {}.\n- _execution_ — 9 of 16 exits were "stop" (56%): price went against the entry before the target came into reach — entries are early or stops sit inside the noise  \n  Exit mix: stop 9, target 5, time 1, signal 1\n- _execution_ — ema_momentum: 8 trades, -69.26, 38% won\n- _execution_ — vwap_reversion: 8 trades, +89.70, 50% won\n- _execution_ — fees were $63.63 against a gross of $+84.07  \n  Costs are the difference between a marginal edge and a loss in this lane.\n- _gate_ — 47 of 63 signals were blocked; the binding constraint was "directional exposure cap reached" (×24)  \n  directional exposure cap reached ×24; already in a position ×15; remaining capacity would create an undersized position ×8\n- _world_ — No significant forex news in the last 24 hours; market remains quiet (quiet)\n- _evidence_ — ema_momentum evidence state: quarantine  \n  measured no edge after 36 trades: PF 0.57, expectancy -9.34, net -336.14\n- _evidence_ — news_catalyst evidence state: unproven  \n  still observing — needs validated held-out research, sessions, trades, profit factor, expectancy, net pnl\n- _evidence_ — vwap_reversion evidence state: quarantine  \n  measured no edge after 46 trades: PF 0.80, expectancy -4.92, net -226.36\n- _ops_ — restart: process restart signal — preserved 1 position(s)\n- _ops_ — restart: process restart signal — preserved 1 position(s)\n- _ops_ — restart: process restart signal — preserved 2 position(s)\n\n**How it gets better**\n\n- Most exits were stops, so tonight''s search will widen the stop multiple and re-test entry timing rather than chase a bigger target.\n- ema_momentum is quarantined (measured no edge after 36 trades: PF 0.57, expectancy -9