nSWEEP\nBULLISH\n09/25/26\n$577.50\n$26.7K\n201\n855\n\nMU\nPUT\nTRADE\nBEARISH\n10/02/26\n$1050.00\n$28.8K\n87\n573\n\nExplanation\nThese itemized elaborations have been created using the accompanying table. \n• Regarding NVDA (NASDAQ:NVDA), we observe a call option sweep with bearish sentiment. It expires in 4 day(s) on September 25, 2026. Parties traded 200 contract(s) at a $230.00 strike. This particular call needed to be split into 6 different trades to become filled. The total cost received by the writing party (or parties) was $38.8K, with a price of $194.0 per contract. There were 62908 open contracts at this strike prior to today, and today 67985 contract(s) were bought and sold. \n• For INTC (NASDAQ:INTC), we notice a call option trade that happens to be bullish, expiring in 39 day(s) on October 30, 2026. This event was a transfer of 28 contract(s) at a $125.00 strike. The total cost received by the writing party (or parties) was $30.9K, with a price of $1105.0 per contract. There were 13328 open contracts at this strike prior to today, and today 9825 contract(s) were bought and sold. \n• For ALGM (NASDAQ:ALGM), we notice a call option trade that happens to be bullish, expiring in 60 day(s) on November 20, 2026. This event was a transfer of 1419 contract(s) at a $35.00 strike. The total cost received by the writing party (or parties) was $610.1K, with a price of $430.0 per contract. There were 95 open contracts at this strike prior to today, and today 4421 contract(s) were bought and sold. \n• Regarding TSM (NYSE:TSM), we observe a call option sweep with bearish sentiment. It expires in 25 day(s) on October 16, 2026. Parties traded 200 contract(s) at a $500.00 strike. This particular call needed to be split into 3 different trades to become filled. The total cost received by the writing party (or parties) was $35.0K, with a price of $175.0 per contract. There were 7242 open contracts at this strike prior to today, and today 1889 contract(s) were bought and