-impacting timetable.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "confirmed_company_event", "comparator": "eq", "threshold": null, "window_hours": 24}, {"condition": "AAPL breaks above its supplied 20-day high and holds there after a new Apple-confirmed event.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "price", "comparator": "gt", "threshold": 336.2, "window_hours": 4}, {"condition": "AAPL trades below the supplied analyst target mean while no Apple-confirmed catalyst emerges.", "direction": "bearish", "metric": "price", "comparator": "lt", "threshold": 327.2, "window_hours": 4}, {"condition": "Current-quarter downward EPS revisions continue to exceed upward revisions over the next revision window.", "direction": "bearish", "metric": "eps_revision_balance", "comparator": "lt", "threshold": 0, "window_hours": null}]',replace('**No trade today.** The only potentially tradeable item is a September 16 report that Apple has discussed an AI-inference server using its own chips and NVIDIA networking. It is a report of a possible long-dated project, not an Apple-confirmed launch, order, guidance change, or regulatory decision. The reporting itself says no launch is expected before 2029 and that the project could be cancelled or proceed without NVIDIA technology [ai_server_report]. The stock was already quoted at $332.66 when the report was published [ai_server_price_action], versus the supplied last_close of $332.50 [last_close], so there is no evidence of a fresh post-report repricing to trade.\n\nContext argues for restraint rather than a short: AAPL finished near the top of its 20-day range [position_in_20d_range] after a positive five-day move [move_5d_pct], while the supplied analyst target mean is below the last close [analyst_target_mean, last_close] and current-quarter estimate revisions are net negative [eps_revision_balance]. But a broad-market position near the lower end of its own 20-day range is market context, not an AAPL-specific bearish catalyst. Thesis remains fundamentally constructive—supplied revenue and earnings growth are positive [revenue_growth_yoy, earnings_growth_yoy], and the latest filed quarter was profitable [filed_revenue, filed_net_income, filed_eps_diluted]—but it has no 240-minute trading relevance.\n\nIf forced to run the specified geometry, retain the measured no-news distribution essentially unchanged. The report is stale by the close, speculative, and lacks a dated company action. Do not carry a position into the October 29, 2026 earnings date [next_earnings_date].','\n',char(10)),'','',NULL,2,4,5,'none',0.35499999999999998223,0.58899999999999996802,0.056000000000000005329,0.35999999999999996447,0.33000000000000002664,0.39000000000000003552,0.35493827160493829353,0.25,'No confirmed, near-term firm-specific catalyst remains at the close. The AI-server item is a conditional report with a multi-year horizon, while AAPL is near its 20-day high [position_in_20d_range] and revisions are net negative [eps_revision_balance]. A forced long or short would be a no-news trade','',0,'gpt-5.6-terra','flex',1,16368,2208,852,0.039615999999999997882,26.419095039367674893,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL);
