ts Transportation ETFs: Which Funds Have the Most Fuel-Sensitive Exposure?", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/etfs/sector-etfs/26/09/61826719/j-b-hunts-diesel-shock-hits-transportation-etfs-which-funds-have-the-most-fuel-sensitive-exposure", "first_public_at": "2026-09-16T18:57:39+00:00", "age_minutes": 174.0, "weight": "primary"}, {"news_id": 293, "headline": "Tesla Killed Its Solar Roof. Now Elon Musk Wants 100 GW of Solar", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/26/09/61825724/tesla-100gw-solar", "first_public_at": "2026-09-16T18:24:40+00:00", "age_minutes": 207.0, "weight": "primary"}, {"news_id": 283, "headline": "Tesla Gets Love From Ron Baron for Not Hitting Ducks: \u2018Time to Buy The Stock is Now\u2019", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/long-ideas/26/09/61824663/tesla-gets-love-from-ron-baron-for-not-hitting-ducks-time-to-buy-the-stock-is-now", "first_public_at": "2026-09-16T17:58:36+00:00", "age_minutes": 233.0, "weight": "primary"}, {"news_id": 284, "headline": "Stocks Rise On Dovish Fed Hike Hopes\u2014Strong Retail Sales Surprise", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/Opinion/26/09/61824301/stocks-rise-on-dovish-fed-hike-hopes-strong-retail-sales-surprise", "first_public_at": "2026-09-16T17:48:01+00:00", "age_minutes": 243.6, "weight": "primary"}, {"news_id": 275, "headline": "Gas Prices Fuel a Hybrid Boom: Why Can''t GM Cash In on It?", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/prediction-markets/26/09/61822555/gm-hybrid-boom-gas-prices", "first_public_at": "2026-09-16T16:47:07+00:00", "age_minutes": 304.5, "weight": "supporting"}, {"news_id": 271, "headline": "Intel Analyst Raises Price Target On Terafab, AI-Driven Turnaround", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/analyst-stock-ratings/price-target/26/09/61820775/intel-analyst-raises-price-target-on-terafab-ai-driven-turnaround", "first_public_at": "2026-09-16T15:52:33+00:00", "age_minutes": 359.1, "weight": "primary"}, {"news_id": 248, "headline": "Tesla''s Cybercab Under the