the announcement-period high.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "firm-specific timestamped announcement and price acceptance", "comparator": "any", "threshold": null, "window_hours": 4}, {"condition": "META rejects the recent-range high and then trades below its opening-range low while broad technology remains weak.", "direction": "bearish", "metric": "price acceptance below opening-range low", "comparator": "any", "threshold": null, "window_hours": 4}, {"condition": "A credible analyst or company update changes current-quarter earnings expectations from the presently negative revision balance.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "eps_revision_balance", "comparator": "gt", "threshold": 0, "window_hours": 24}, {"condition": "A new negative firm-specific regulatory, advertising-demand, AI-capex, or product-safety disclosure is confirmed by Meta or a primary regulator.", "direction": "bearish", "metric": "timestamped primary-source disclosure", "comparator": "any", "threshold": null, "window_hours": 24}]',replace('No trade in META at 07:23Z. There is no qualifying, timestamped firm-specific catalyst inside the next trading window. Meta’s Meta One subscription announcement is real and dated September 15–16, but it is already public and lacks a precise event timestamp in the source; the September 16 analyst reiterations are CONTEXT, not a tradable catalyst. The market has already repriced the recent bullish narrative: META closed near its 20-day high and materially above its 50-day mean [position_in_20d_range; distance_from_50d_mean_pct]. That leaves poor entry asymmetry for a fresh long, particularly with current-quarter revisions decisively negative [eps_revisions_up_30d; eps_revisions_down_30d; eps_revision_balance].\n\nThe multi-month operating picture remains strong: quarterly revenue and net income were substantial, margins are high, and reported year-over-year revenue growth is positive [filed_revenue; filed_net_income; filed_eps_diluted; revenue_growth_yoy; gross_margin; profit_margin]. But those are THESIS inputs, not a reason to force a four-hour trade. The exact-geometry no-news tape is also unfavorable for a long: the stop has historically occurred first much more often than the target [MEASURED BASE RATE]. Maintain no position. If a fresh, company-confirmed monetization, product, or regulatory event appears with a timestamp during the session, reassess; otherwise the right action is to preserve risk budget.','\n',char(10)),'','',NULL,1,3,6,'none',0.28399999999999998578,0.65200000000000004618,0.064000000000000003552,0.29,0.26000000000000000888,0.32000000000000001776,0.2839506172839505993,0.25,'Do not open a position today. There is no fresh timestamped META-specific event, the stock is extended within its recent range [position_in_20d_range; distance_from_50d_mean_pct], and current-quarter revisions are net negative [eps_revision_balance]. With no catalyst, use the supplied no-news base r','',0,'gpt-5.6-terra','flex',1,17137,3065,1628,0.040461000000000000298,29.677483081817626953,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL);
