, "last_close"]}, {"claim": "The specified intraday geometry has a materially worse measured stop-first rate than target-first rate absent news.", "facts": ["measured_base_rate"]}, {"claim": "Macro rate sensitivity and AI-valuation debate can dominate this peripheral company item.", "facts": ["beta", "forward_pe", "trailing_pe", "market_regime"]}]','[{"condition": "A new NVIDIA, Lucid, or Bolt filing/release discloses a binding NVIDIA hardware or software purchase commitment rather than a platform reference.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "disclosed_contract_value_or_units", "comparator": "gt", "threshold": null, "window_hours": 24}, {"condition": "NVDA trades and holds above the prior regular-session high on sustained post-open demand after the first hour, without a broad QQQ reversal.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "price_vs_prior_session_high", "comparator": "gt", "threshold": 219.9, "window_hours": 2}, {"condition": "A company-specific release discloses a delay, cancellation, export restriction, or material competitive displacement affecting NVIDIA revenue or shipments.", "direction": "bearish", "metric": "material_company_specific_negative_event", "comparator": "any", "threshold": null, "window_hours": 24}, {"condition": "NVDA breaks below the prior regular-session low while the broader technology tape is also weak after the open.", "direction": "bearish", "metric": "price_vs_prior_session_low", "comparator": "lt", "threshold": 217.15, "window_hours": 2}]',replace('No trade. The only fresh, confirmed firm-linked event is Lucid and Bolt’s September 17 announcement that their planned autonomous fleet will use NVIDIA Hyperion. It is a real commercial-design-win signal, but it contains no disclosed NVIDIA revenue, purchase commitment, or delivery schedule sufficient to alter a four-hour NVDA trade. [Lucid/Bolt release; evidence: lucid_bolt_fleet]\n\nThe market had already repriced NVDA higher during the September 17 session, closing up on the day, while the supplied after-hours snapshot was softer than the regular close. [evidence: nvda_sep17_session; last_close] This makes the morning setup especially vulnerable to expiry-related and macro flow rather than a clean continuation in response to the Lucid headline. Today is also triple-witching, which is a market-structure event, not an NVDA catalyst.\n\nContext is supportive but not actionable: NVDA sits below the midpoint of neither extreme—the stock is at position_in_20d_range and only distance_from_50d_mean_pct from its 50-day mean—and estimate revisions are strongly positive (eps_revisions_up_30d versus eps_revisions_down_30d; eps_revision_balance). Those are days-to-weeks inputs and cannot justify improving the supplied no-news intraday base rate. The broad AI and rate narrative is mixed: higher-yield pressure and valuation criticism argue against chasing a one-session rebound.\n\nThe multi-month thesis remains strong: revenue_growth_yoy, earnings_growth_yoy, gross_margin, profit_margin, forward_pe, and filed_net_income support exceptional operating momentum. Competition from Huawei and the lack of disclosed economics in peripheral partnerships remain risks, but neither changes today’s decision. The next scheduled earnings date is next_earnings_date, well outside this trade window.\n\nFor the stated long geometry, retain the measured no-news distribution essentially unchanged: the confirmed item is too small and too broadly disseminated to overcome the tape’s unfavorable target/stop asymmetry. Veto opening a position today rather than converting the lack of a long edge into a discretionary short: the same positive revision backdrop and recent rebound make a short equally unsupported.','\n',char(10)),'','',NULL,2,4,7,'none',0.27300000000000004263,0.63499999999999996447,0.091999999999999992894,0.23000000000000002664,NULL,NULL,0.27263374485596707508,0.25,'Do not open an NVDA position today. The confirmed Lucid/Bolt item is strategically favorable but lacks disclosed NVIDIA economics and has already been followed by a strong regular-session rally. The supplied exact-geometry base rate remains stop-dominant, while triple-witching and rate-sensitive tec',' | catalyst undated or stale, demoted to context',0,'gpt-5.6-terra','flex',1,18545,2058,608,0.040892999999999997129,22.913865804672242099,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL);
