ner=include&count=10", "accession": "0000320193-26-000020", "form": "10-Q", "filed_at": "2026-07-31T00:00:00+00:00", "xbrl_tag": "EarningsPerShareDiluted", "note": "as filed, USD/shares"}, {"label": "Apple retail-launch date", "value": 18.0, "unit": "day of month", "period": "September 2026", "quote": "On Friday, September 18, Apple debuted iPhone 18 Pro and iPhone 18 Pro Max, as well as Apple Watch Series 12, Apple Watch Ultra 4, and AirPods 5, at Apple Store locations worldwide.", "url": "https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/09/the-latest-iphone-apple-watch-and-airpods-lineups-arrive-in-stores-worldwide/", "tier": "searched", "source": "web_search"}, {"label": "Maximum carrier credit", "value": 1200.0, "unit": "USD", "period": "iPhone 18 launch offers", "quote": "This fall, customers can get up to $1,200 in credit with select carriers when they trade in iPhone 14 or newer in any condition to put toward iPhone 18 Pro or iPhone 18 Pro Max.", "url": "https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/09/get-ready-to-experience-iphone-18-pro-the-new-apple-watch-lineup-and-airpods-5/", "tier": "searched", "source": "web_search"}, {"label": "AAPL September 17 daily return", "value": 1.38, "unit": "percent", "period": "September 17, 2026", "quote": "Sep 17, 2026 | 337.00 | 334.77 | 338.20 | 330.20 | 35.00M | +1.38%", "url": "https://www.investing.com/equities/apple-computer-inc-historical-data", "tier": "searched", "source": "web_search"}]','[{"news_id": 375, "headline": "Ten-Year Treasury Yield Hits 5%: Why QQQ Could Face More Pressure Than Value ETFs", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/etfs/sector-etfs/26/09/61857522/treasury-yield-5-percent-qqq-versus-value-etfs", "first_public_at": "2026-09-17T20:51:04+00:00", "age_minutes": 637.9, "weight": "primary"}, {"news_id": 365, "headline": "Apple\u2019s iPhone Upgrade Cycle Looks Strong As Carrier Incentives Hit $1,200", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/analyst-stock-ratings/analyst-color/26/09/61852348/apples-iphone-upgrade-cycle-looks-strong-as-carrier-incentives-hit-1200", "first_public_at": "2026-09-17T17:44:06+00:00", "age_minutes": 824.9, "weight": "primary"}, {"news_id": 368, "headline": "Triple Witching, Falling Oil, and Fed Hopium Drive Up Stocks, But Downside Risks Remain", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/Opinion/26/09/61851724/triple-witching-falling-oil-and-fed-hopium-drive-up-stocks-but-downside-risks-remain", "first_public_at": "2026-09-17T17:18:45+00:00", "age_minutes": 850.3, "weight": "primary"}, {"news_id": 358, "headline": "What''s Going On With Apple Stock Today?", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/trading-ideas/movers/26/09/61850736/whats-going-on-with-apple-stock-today-5", "first_public_at": "2026-09-17T16:45:41+00:00", "age_minutes": 883.3, "weight": "supporting"}, {"news_id": 354, "headline": "Nvidia Is an \u2018Awesome Company,\u2019 but Its Stock Is Priced as \u2018Greatest Company Ever,\u2019 Damodaran Says", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/prediction-markets/26/09/61847834/nvidia-stock-valuation-aswath-damodaran-ai-growth", "first_public_at": "2026-09-17T15:28:47+00:00", "age_minutes": 960.2, "weight": "primary"}, {"news_id": 338, "headline": "Intel Stock Could Nearly Double to $200 in 2 Years, Analyst Says \u2014 Potential Apple, Tesla, and AI Chip Deals Could Fuel the Rally", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/09/61839701/intel-stock-could-nearly-double-to-200-in-2-years-analyst-says-potential-apple-tesla-and-ai-chip-deals-could-fuel-the-rally", "first_public_at": "2026-09-17T12:25:57+00:00", "age_minutes": 1143.1, "weight": "supporting"}, {"news_id": 321, "headline": "Performance Comparison: Apple And Competitors In Technology Hardware, Storage &amp; Peripherals Industry", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/news/26/09/61835330/performance-comparison-apple-and-competitors-technology-hardware-storage-amp-peripherals-industry", "first_public_at": "2026-09-17T09:58:22+00:00", "age_minutes": 1290.6, "weight": "supporting"}, {"news_id": 318, "headline": "Bill Ackman Says Nike \u2018Needs Help\u2019 as Alexandre Arnault Joins Board: \u2018Great Development\u2019", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/09/61834651/bill-ackman-says-alexandre-arnault-can-help-nike-calls-it-board-appointment-great-development", "first_public_at": "2026-09-17T08:54:16+00:00", "age_minutes": 1354.7, "weight": "primary"}, {"news_id": 309, "headline": "SNAP Stock Pops 4% Overnight on Robinhood After NVDA, AWS and Salesforce Partnerships: What\u2019s Driving the Move", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/09/61833876/snap-partners-with-salesforce-aws-and-nvidia-for-specs-ar-glasses", "first_public_at": "2026-09-17T07:14:14+00:00", "age_minutes": 1454.8, "weight": "primary"}]','[{"claim": "The retail launch and carrier offers reinforce the iPhone upgrade-cycle case.", "facts": ["catalyst: Apple official retail-launch announcement", "catalyst: Apple official carrier-offer announcement", "[365] Bank of America upgrade-cycle story"]}, {"claim": "The underlying operating picture is strong.", "facts": ["revenue_growth_yoy", "earnings_growth_yoy", "gross_margin", "profit_margin", "filed_revenue", "filed_net_income", "filed_eps_diluted"]}, {"claim": "Short positioning is not an obvious source of forced selling.", "facts": ["short_pct_of_float"]}]','[{"claim": "The launch-day catalyst is scheduled and the stock is already extended into it.", "facts": ["last_close", "position_in_20d_range", "high_20d", "distance_from_50d_mean_pct", "move_5d_pct", "evidence: September 17 daily price action"]}, {"claim": "Valuation and analyst-revision context limit upside asymmetry.", "facts": ["trailing_pe", "forward_pe", "analyst_target_mean", "eps_revisions_up_30d", "eps_revisions_down_30d", "eps_revision_balance"]}, {"claim": "A higher-rate backdrop is unfavorable for an expensive mega-cap growth multiple.", "facts": ["[375] Treasury-yield/QQQ story", "spy_position_in_20d_range", "qqq_position_in_20d_range"]}]','[{"condition": "Independent launch-demand reporting shows stronger-than-expected iPhone 18 sell-through or materially extended delivery times attributable to demand, not supply constraints.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "confirmed demand report", "comparator": "any", "threshold": null, "window_hours": 24}, {"condition": "AAPL trades above the supplied 20-day high and holds above it through a full 5-minute bar with broad technology-market confirmation.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "price", "comparator": "gt", "threshold": 338.3, "window_hours": 4}, {"condition": "AAPL breaks below the prior session\u2019s searched intraday low after the retail launch, indicating a launch-day rejection rather than follow-through.", "direction": "bearish", "metric": "price", "comparator": "lt", "threshold": 330.2, "window_hours": 4}, {"condition": "A credible demand report points to weak iPhone 18 availability or demand despite promotional support.", "direction": "bearish", "metric": "confirmed demand report", "comparator": "any", "threshold": null, "window_hours": 24}]',replace('**No trade.** The only near-term, firm-specific event is real: Apple’s iPhone 18 Pro/Pro Max, Apple Watch Series 12/Ultra 4, and AirPods 5 reach stores today, September 18, 2026. Apple also confirms eligible U.S. carrier promotions of up to $1,200 for iPhone 18 Pro models. This supports the upgrade-cycle narrative, but it is a scheduled retail launch—not new demand data—and it was known before today. The stock has already closed near its 20-day high: `last_close`, `position_in_20d_range`, and `distance_from_50d_mean_pct`. AAPL also rose into the event, while the searched daily record shows a positive September 17 session. That leaves poor asymmetry for a four-hour long entry.\n\nContext is restrictive. AAPL trades above the supplied mean analyst target (`analyst_target_mean`) and at elevated supplied valuation multiples (`trailing_pe`, `forward_pe`); current-quarter revisions are net negative (`eps_revisions_up_30d`, `eps_revisions_down_30d`, `eps_revision_balance`). Higher Treasury yields are an additional growth-multiple headwind in the supplied news flow. The business picture remains strong—supplied year-over-year revenue and earnings growth, margins, and the latest filed quarter (`filed_revenue`, `filed_net_income`, `filed_eps_diluted`) support that—but this is thesis, not an intraday edge.\n\nFor the specified long geometry, retain a slightly more cautious version of AAPL’s measured no-news base rate: the scheduled launch is positive but fully telegraphed, while stretched positioning and revision drift favor a failed breakout or stop before a three-ATR target. Do not short a confirmed product-launch day without a clear failure signal; do not buy it after the run-up. Wait for either independently reported launch demand or a decisive rejection of the recent high.','\n',char(10)),'Apple’s iPhone 18 Pro lineup, new Apple Watches, and AirPods 5 arrive in stores worldwide','https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/09/the-latest-iphone-apple-watch-and-airpods-lineups-arrive-in-stores-worldwide/','2026-09-18 00:00:00',5,3,7,'none',0.33000000000000002664,0.5899999999999999467,0.08,0.32000000000000001776,NULL,NULL,0.34567901234567899315,0.25,'Do not open a position: today’s confirmed product availability is a preannounced event, while AAPL is near the supplied 20-day high and above the supplied mean analyst target. Negative net estimate revisions and elevated supplied valuation remove the margin of safety for a launch-day long; there is ','',0,'gpt-5.6-terra','flex',1,17960,2206,691,0.036129999999999999893,27.946902036666871893,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL);
