same-session catalyst. The stock did rise into the close, as shown by the searched market snapshot, so chasing a long opening move would be especially unsupported without a new company-specific development.\n\nUse the measured AMZN base rate essentially unchanged. The trade geometry is unfavorable without news: the stop is reached materially more often than the target in the supplied historical sample, while the stated round-trip cost is meaningful relative to ATR. Do not open a discretionary position solely on broad-rate, AI-capex, crypto, or market-commentary headlines.','\n',char(10)),'','',NULL,1,4,6,'none',0.26100000000000003197,0.65600000000000004973,0.083000000000000007105,0.27000000000000001776,NULL,NULL,0.26131687242798351533,0.25,'Veto: no confirmed AMZN-specific catalyst in the tradable window. The measured no-news distribution for this exact setup is unfavorable, and the stated round-trip cost further raises the bar. Context is constructive but cannot enlarge or create an intraday trade.','',0,'gpt-5.6-terra','flex',1,17838,1919,587,0.034285999999999994258,21.159024953842164862,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL);
