n": "0001628280-26-049270", "form": "10-Q", "filed_at": "2026-07-23T00:00:00+00:00", "xbrl_tag": "EarningsPerShareDiluted", "note": "as filed, USD/shares"}, {"label": "roadster_unveil_date", "value": 1.0, "unit": "date day-of-month", "period": "2026-10-01", "quote": "Tesla on Saturday posted a countdown on its website pointing to an October 1 launch of the Roadster, nearly a decade after the electric-vehicle maker first revealed a next-generation version of its original sports car.", "url": "https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/tesla-signals-oct-1-launch-for-longdelayed-roadster-4898685", "tier": "searched", "source": "web_search"}, {"label": "roadster_delay_history", "value": 2017.0, "unit": "year", "period": "history through 2026-09-12", "quote": "Tesla first unveiled the next-generation Roadster in 2017 and said deliveries would begin in 2020, but the program has faced repeated delays.", "url": "https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/tesla-signals-oct-1-launch-for-longdelayed-roadster-4898685", "tier": "searched", "source": "web_search"}, {"label": "recent_market_close", "value": 364.27, "unit": "usd", "period": "2026-09-18 close", "quote": "As of the latest close, Tesla traded at $364.27 with a market cap of $1.44 trillion and volume of 51.81 million shares.", "url": "https://www.marketbeat.com/stocks/NASDAQ/TSLA/chart/", "tier": "searched", "source": "web_search"}]','[{"news_id": 436, "headline": "This Week in TSLA: Elon Musk Touts Roadster Debut, Fuels SpaceX Merger  Talks and More", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/09/61884324/this-week-in-tsla-elon-musk-touts-roadster-debut-fuels-spacex-merger-talks-and-more", "first_public_at": "2026-09-19T13:00:39+00:00", "age_minutes": 1115.3, "weight": "supporting"}, {"news_id": 435, "headline": "Benzinga Bulls and Bears: Generac, Salesforce, Netflix", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/market-summary/26/09/61884239/benzinga-bulls-and-bears-generac-salesforce-netflix", "first_public_at": "2026-09-19T12:00:44+00:00", "age_minutes": 1175.3, "weight": "supporting"}]','[{"claim": "The Roadster event is officially signaled and could support attention into October, but it is not actionable today.", "facts": ["evidence:roadster_unveil_date"]}, {"claim": "TSLA is not at the top of its recent range and analyst mean target is above the last close.", "facts": ["position_in_20d_range", "analyst_target_mean", "last_close"]}, {"claim": "Revenue growth remains positive.", "facts": ["revenue_growth_yoy", "filed_revenue"]}]','[{"claim": "Current-quarter estimate revisions are decisively negative.", "facts": ["eps_revisions_up_30d", "eps_revisions_down_30d", "eps_revision_balance"]}, {"claim": "The Roadster announcement carries execution-credibility risk because the program has faced repeated delays.", "facts": ["evidence:roadster_unveil_date", "evidence:roadster_delay_history"]}, {"claim": "Valuation is demanding relative to current profitability and earnings growth.", "facts": ["trailing_pe", "forward_pe", "earnings_growth_yoy", "gross_margin", "profit_margin"]}, {"claim": "There is no high-short-interest positioning that would amplify a bullish headline into a squeeze.", "facts": ["short_pct_of_float"]}]','[{"condition": "Tesla publishes an official, timestamped disclosure of a material production, delivery, regulatory, financing, or product-commercialization development.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "official_firm_specific_disclosure", "comparator": "any", "threshold": null, "window_hours": 24}, {"condition": "Tesla officially postpones or materially narrows the October 1 Roadster event.", "direction": "bearish", "metric": "roadster_event_status", "comparator": "any", "threshold": null, "window_hours": 24}, {"condition": "A new analyst revision batch shows upward revisions exceeding downward revisions for the current quarter.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "eps_revision_balance", "comparator": "gt", "threshold": 0, "window_hours": 24}, {"condition": "A new analyst revision batch keeps current-quarter revision balance below zero.", "direction": "bearish", "metric": "eps_revision_balance", "comparator": "lt", "threshold": 0, "window_hours": 24}]',replace('**No trade today.** There is no dated, firm-specific TSLA event inside the desk’s roughly one-day catalyst window. The only confirmed company event found is the Tesla Roadster unveil on **October 1, 2026**, which is too far away to qualify as an intraday catalyst for the September 20 session. The recent stories are weekend recaps rather than new price-setting disclosures. The Roadster date is real, but its prior delays make it context rather than a reason to alter the measured no-news intraday distribution.\n\nPrice context is neutral rather than washed out: TSLA last closed at [last_close], sits at [position_in_20d_range] of its 20-day range, and is [distance_from_50d_mean_pct] above its 50-day mean. The five-day move is essentially flat at [move_5d_pct]. Against that, estimates have deteriorated: [eps_revisions_down_30d] current-quarter cuts versus [eps_revisions_up_30d] increases, for [eps_revision_balance]. Valuation leaves little cushion for a promotional product-event narrative, with [trailing_pe] trailing P/E and [forward_pe] forward P/E. The market is not positioned for a squeeze, with short interest at [short_pct_of_float].\n\nThe multi-month picture remains mixed: reported second-quarter revenue was [filed_revenue] and diluted EPS was [filed_eps_diluted], while revenue growth is [revenue_growth_yoy] but earnings growth is [earnings_growth_yoy], consistent with pressure on profitability. Gross margin was [gross_margin] and profit margin was [profit_margin]. None of that changes the next 240 minutes.\n\nUse the supplied no-news base rate unchanged. A Roadster reveal scheduled for October 1 is neither fresh enough nor close enough to justify changing the odds today. The next scheduled earnings date is [next_earnings_date], and the desk must not hold through it.','\n',char(10)),'','',NULL,1,3,4,'none',0.32099999999999999644,0.60299999999999993605,0.075999999999999996447,0.33000000000000002664,0.29,0.37000000000000001776,0.3209876543209876587,0.25,'Veto: no verified firm-specific catalyst is inside the next-day trading window. The confirmed Roadster unveil is an October 1 event, not a September 20 intraday event; the fresh items are recaps. Negative estimate revisions and rich valuation reinforce the decision not to force a directional positio','',1,'gpt-5.6-terra','flex',1,16042,2023,688,0.033113999999999998991,23.341446161270140713,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL);
