'[{"condition": "NVIDIA publishes a new, timestamped press release, SEC filing, or investor-relations update containing a material change to demand, supply, guidance, product availability, or a major customer commitment.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "official NVIDIA material announcement", "comparator": "any", "threshold": null, "window_hours": 24}, {"condition": "A U.S. or Chinese government announcement explicitly expands permitted sales of NVIDIA advanced AI accelerators to China or removes a product-specific restriction.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "official product-specific export-policy action", "comparator": "any", "threshold": null, "window_hours": 72}, {"condition": "A U.S. or Chinese government announcement explicitly adds NVIDIA advanced AI accelerators to export restrictions or imposes a new product-specific license barrier.", "direction": "bearish", "metric": "official product-specific export-policy action", "comparator": "any", "threshold": null, "window_hours": 72}, {"condition": "NVDA trades above the supplied recent high after a fresh firm-specific announcement.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "NVDA price", "comparator": "gt", "threshold": 234.8, "window_hours": 24}, {"condition": "NVDA trades below the supplied recent low following a fresh adverse firm-specific announcement.", "direction": "bearish", "metric": "NVDA price", "comparator": "lt", "threshold": 207.4, "window_hours": 24}]',replace('No trade today. There is no dated, firm-specific NVIDIA operating event inside the next 240 minutes. The newest supplied items are CEO-personal-tax commentary, opinion/technical commentary, and semiconductor or macro stories; none changes NVIDIA revenue, supply, guidance, or access to customers. The U.S.-China meeting is a real scheduled macro event, but it is later this week rather than an immediate NVIDIA catalyst, and its possible AI/trade outcome is not yet known. ([apnews.com](https://apnews.com/article/2c7f54f07e755f506d9db9b91df282bd?utm_source=openai))\n\nContext is constructive but already favorable: estimates are being raised decisively (eps_revisions_up_30d, eps_revisions_down_30d, eps_revision_balance), while the shares have advanced recently (move_5d_pct) and are above the intermediate mean (distance_from_50d_mean_pct). Price is near the middle of its recent range (position_in_20d_range), not at an obvious washed-out entry. With no company-specific news edge, retain the measured no-news outcome distribution rather than inventing a directional adjustment.\n\nThesis remains strong: supplied growth, margin, valuation, and estimate-revision data support the longer-term operating picture (revenue_growth_yoy, earnings_growth_yoy, gross_margin, profit_margin, forward_pe). That is not a valid reason to enter a short-duration trade. The desk should wait for a timestamped NVIDIA release, filing, customer order, export-policy action specifically naming covered NVIDIA products, or an actual summit outcome.','\n',char(10)),'','',NULL,1,4,8,'none',0.28899999999999996802,0.63499999999999996447,0.075999999999999996447,0.3,NULL,NULL,0.28909465020576128324,0.25,'No qualifying firm-specific catalyst exists for a trade that must close within 240 minutes. The only current potential market-moving item is unresolved macro policy risk ahead of the September 24 U.S.-China meeting; it is neither immediate nor specific enough to override NVDA''s unfavorable measured ','',0,'gpt-5.6-terra','flex',1,17025,3347,2133,0.047107000000000001094,34.489246845245360439,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL);
