": "0001628280-26-049270", "form": "10-Q", "filed_at": "2026-07-23T00:00:00+00:00", "xbrl_tag": "EarningsPerShareDiluted", "note": "as filed, USD/shares"}, {"label": "roadster_event_confirmation", "value": 1.0, "unit": "event date (October 1)", "period": "2026-10-01", "quote": "Tesla says the October 1 event will reveal pricing, specs, and production targets.", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/09/20/tesla-reopens-50000-roadster-reservations-october-1-unveil/", "tier": "searched", "source": "web_search"}, {"label": "roadster_reservation_payment", "value": 50000.0, "unit": "USD deposit", "period": "reported 2026-09-20", "quote": "Tesla has reopened reservations for its next-generation Roadster, asking buyers for a $50,000 deposit about two weeks before the car is even unveiled.", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/09/20/tesla-reopens-50000-roadster-reservations-october-1-unveil/", "tier": "searched", "source": "web_search"}, {"label": "nhtsa_cybercab_investigation", "value": 21.0, "unit": "days before current date", "period": "2026-09-04", "quote": "The US Department of Transportation\u2019s National Highway Traffic Safety Administration (NHTSA) today announced that it has opened an Audit Query (AQ) to investigate Tesla\u2019s certification that its new Cybercab meets all applicable Federal Motor Vehicle Safety Standards (FMVSS).", "url": "https://www.nhtsa.gov/press-releases/investigation-tesla-cybercab-self-certification", "tier": "searched", "source": "web_search"}]','[{"news_id": 465, "headline": "Tesla Reopens Roadster Reservations Ahead of Oct. 1 Reveal: Here\u2019s What You Need to Know", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/09/61886877/tesla-reopens-roadster-reservations-ahead-of-oct-1-reveal-heres-what-you-need-to-know", "first_public_at": "2026-09-21T05:46:46+00:00", "age_minutes": 111.5, "weight": "primary"}, {"news_id": 451, "headline": "EXCLUSIVE: Tesla Vehicles Maintain Nearly 19% Junk Title Rate Across Age Groups, VIN Analysis Shows", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/09/61885437/exclusive-tesla-vehicles-maintain-nearly-19-junk-title-rate-across-age-groups-vin-analysis-shows", "first_public_at": "2026-09-20T13:30:21+00:00", "age_minutes": 1087.9, "weight": "primary"}, {"news_id": 450, "headline": "Brace For Fuel Hike, Tesla Faces NHTSA Scrutiny and More: This Week in Mobility", "url": "https://www.benzinga.com/markets/tech/26/09/61885317/brace-for-fuel-hike-tesla-faces-nhtsa-scrutiny-and-more-this-week-in-mobility", "first_public_at": "2026-09-20T12:00:08+00:00", "age_minutes": 1178.1, "weight": "primary"}]','[{"claim": "The Roadster item can sustain narrative interest into the October event.", "facts": ["roadster_reservation_page", "roadster_event_confirmation", "move_5d_pct", "position_in_20d_range"]}, {"claim": "Fundamental revenue growth and a positive analyst target gap leave room for constructive sentiment if Tesla supplies credible production details.", "facts": ["revenue_growth_yoy", "analyst_target_mean", "last_close", "analyst_count"]}, {"claim": "Short-covering is not a meaningful requirement for upside; the thesis would need genuine incremental demand or production information.", "facts": ["short_pct_of_float", "roadster_event_confirmation"]}]','[{"claim": "The new reservation item is promotional rather than an operating disclosure, so it does not justify changing the adverse no-news intraday geometry.", "facts": ["roadster_reservation_page", "roadster_event_confirmation"]}, {"claim": "Valuation and estimate direction are poor support for adding long exposure without a hard catalyst.", "facts": ["trailing_pe", "forward_pe", "eps_revisions_down_30d", "eps_revisions_up_30d", "eps_revision_balance"]}, {"claim": "Profit growth and margins make the shares vulnerable if the Roadster event lacks a credible production timetable or economics.", "facts": ["earnings_growth_yoy", "gross_margin", "profit_margin", "filed_net_income", "filed_eps_diluted"]}, {"claim": "Cybercab regulatory scrutiny remains an overhang, but it is not fresh enough to support a new short today.", "facts": ["nhtsa_cybercab_investigation"]}]','[{"condition": "Tesla publishes a primary-source Roadster production target or first-delivery date at the October event.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "official production target", "comparator": "any", "threshold": null, "window_hours": null}, {"condition": "Tesla publishes a primary-source Roadster price and confirms binding reservation conversion or order volume.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "binding reservations or orders", "comparator": "any", "threshold": null, "window_hours": null}, {"condition": "NHTSA escalates the Cybercab matter from an audit query to a formal enforcement action, recall, or deployment restriction.", "direction": "bearish", "metric": "NHTSA action", "comparator": "any", "threshold": null, "window_hours": null}, {"condition": "Consensus revisions cease deteriorating and turn net positive for the current quarter.", "direction": "bullish", "metric": "eps_revision_balance", "comparator": "gt", "threshold": 0, "window_hours": null}]',replace('**No trade today.** The fresh item is a weekend reopening of Roadster reservations, while the actual Roadster reveal is scheduled for October 1 rather than within the next trading day. Tesla’s own Roadster page currently offers a “Reserve Now” path (evidence: roadster_reservation_page), and independent reporting says the reveal will cover pricing, specifications and production targets (evidence: roadster_event_confirmation). That is a real product-cycle headline, but not a timestamped, near-term operating result or order disclosure that justifies overriding TSLA’s unfavorable intraday base rate.\n\nThe tape context is neutral rather than washed out: TSLA closed at last_close, sits at position_in_20d_range of its 20-day range, and is distance_from_50d_mean_pct above its 50-day mean. The recent move is only move_5d_pct, so there is no clear evidence that this particular reservation item created a tradable dislocation. The setup is further constrained by trailing_pe and forward_pe, alongside eps_revision_balance with eps_revisions_down_30d cuts versus eps_revisions_up_30d increases. The scheduled next_earnings_date is still days_to_earnings away and must not be held through.\n\nLonger term, the operating picture is mixed: filed_revenue and filed_net_income were reported for the latest filed quarter, while revenue_growth_yoy remains positive but earnings_growth_yoy is negative; gross_margin and profit_margin leave little room for another expectation reset. NHTSA’s Cybercab self-certification investigation is confirmed, but it was announced earlier in September and is context—not a new intraday catalyst (evidence: nhtsa_cybercab_investigation).','\n',char(10)),'','',NULL,2,3,3,'none',0.32200000000000001953,0.60099999999999997868,0.077000000000000001776,0.33000000000000002664,NULL,NULL,0.3209876543209876587,0.25,'Do not open a position: there is no qualifying timestamped catalyst for the next 240 minutes, and the confirmed Roadster reveal is an October 1 event rather than today’s trading event. The small departure from the measured no-news base rate is not sufficient to overcome the unfavorable target-first ','dropped: roadster_reservation_page: no value',0,'gpt-5.6-terra','flex',1,16155,2658,1167,0.03703699999999999548,30.181132078170778143,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL);
