e scheduled earnings release [next_earnings_date; days_to_earnings].','','',NULL,1,4,5,'none',0.28100000000000004973,0.65300000000000002486,0.066000000000000005329,0.3,NULL,NULL,0.28086419753086424577,0.25,'Veto opening a META position today: no actionable, newly disclosed company catalyst is confirmed for the next trading day. The sole dated item is a previously announced dividend record date, while negative EPS revision balance and elevated recent technical position make an unsupported long especiall','dropped: Confirmed META dividend record date: no value',1,'gpt-5.6-terra','flex',2,22222,3699,2664,0.059350000000000004973,35.354286193847657138,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'',NULL);
