ly when the news hit; there is no evidence here of a durable, NVDA-specific repricing. The catalyst is therefore too small and too old for a new 240-minute position.\n\nContext is constructive but argues for restraint, not a chase: NVDA closed at [last_close], has gained [move_5d_pct], sits at [position_in_20d_range] of its 20-day range, and is [distance_from_50d_mean_pct] above its 50-day mean. The broad tape is also extended, with QQQ at [qqq_position_in_20d_range] of its own 20-day range. Fundamental context remains strong—estimate revisions are overwhelmingly positive [eps_revisions_up_30d; eps_revisions_down_30d; eps_revision_balance] and profitability/growth metrics are high [revenue_growth_yoy; earnings_growth_yoy; gross_margin; profit_margin]—but those are multi-week context, not a reason to enlarge an intraday trade.\n\nFor the specified stop/target/timeout geometry, retain the measured no-news NVDA base rate rather than manufacture an edge from this announcement. The veto is timing: the news has already circulated, its commercial value to NVIDIA is unspecified, and the stock/risk regime is already elevated.','\n',char(10)),'Einride Enters Strategic Collaboration with NVIDIA to Advance its Autonomous Trucking on NVIDIA Hyperion','https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/09/21/3365322/0/en/einride-enters-strategic-collaboration-with-nvidia-to-advance-its-autonomous-trucking-on-nvidia-hyperion.html','2026-09-21 10:30:00',3,6,7,'none',0.28499999999999996447,0.62900000000000000355,0.085999999999999978683,0.28499999999999996447,0.28499999999999996447,0.62900000000000000355,0.28497942386831276451,0.25,'Do not open a position: the Einride partnership is confirmed but lacks disclosed NVIDIA economics, was released before the current session, and has no evidence of a continuing company-specific price impulse. NVDA is already elevated within its recent range [position_in_20d_range] after a strong five','dropped: Einride collaboration confirmation: no value',0,